@enabled
@description("Update a session record's stream state. Read-merges the existing row (update()): only the fields in `payload` change; the @required fields (participantId, spaceId, ...) and every other omitted field inherit from the persisted row instead of being wiped (memql#1628). The session row must already exist.")
mutation session mutationUpdateSessionStreams {
